  "title": "CitiTrends Sets Date for Fourth Quarter and Full Year 2025 Earnings Release and Conference Call",
  "summary": "SAVANNAH, Ga. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Mar. 3, 2026-- Citi Trends, Inc. (NASDAQ: CTRN) today announced plans to release its earnings for the fourth quarter and full year 2025 before the market opens on Tuesday, March 17, 2026. Citi Trends will host a conference call on the same day at 9:00 a.m. ET.",
